  "ReviewNotes": [
    "Only the four reviewed construction DownValues and the exactly recomputed loader signature change. Existing checkers, reducers, model data and numerical adapters retain all ten cold definition fields and manifest bytes.",
    "Graded color transport uses literal same-state metadata, exact basis closure and inverse-transpose representation rows. A full independent-row matrix determines the candidate from constructed seeds. Every coefficient then receives every ordinary validation assignment; failed or unsupported attempts fall back and retain completed reports.",
    "Sparse particular-point construction uses precisely the retained trial, ordered coordinates and solution/free-zero rules. Known failed or opposite-sign current point checks prohibit its admission. Incomplete family proof is not a point failure. External-only preparation precedes consistent reference resolution; strict all-parameter validation and independent Feynman comparison remain required.",
    "The added pure-vector source class uses only existing exactly matched cubics and an existing metric operator calibrated from the complete known lower amplitude. Every original graph and propagator is covered. No target answer, independent benchmark term, numerical coefficient fit or new independent interaction is introduced.",
    "This review preserves finite historical validation evidence only, including its real contexts, options and timing. It makes no new-constructor or all-1422-case success claim. The strict supplemental equal-mass check must still be repeated at C5."
